WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.450
Read every line of the quote.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.711
Moving.

00:00:05.711 --> 00:00:06.075
Fuel.

00:00:06.075 --> 00:00:06.513
Admin.

00:00:06.513 --> 00:00:10.889
And a binding estimate fee, of two thousand and one dollars.

00:00:10.889 --> 00:00:14.025
A fee for promising the price won't change.

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:16.460
Add up every line yourself.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.024
Ask what each fee is for.

00:00:18.024 --> 00:00:20.465
If something is off, have it corrected.

00:00:20.465 --> 00:00:23.970
And if you don't agree with a fee, ask them to waive it.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.145
Know what a quote is hiding.

00:00:27.145 --> 00:00:28.500
packedrabbit.com.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.120
If this helped, like it, share it with someone who's moving, and subscribe.
